    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτυγχάνω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έτῠχον,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meet with in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					128
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1334
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπικουρίας ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.87
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μάχας</span>
			<i>fall into</i> quarrel, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.42
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρείττονος</span> Prov. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.16.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χοιπάδος</span>
			<i>hit</i>
			
			<i>upon</i> a rock, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.480
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλείστων ἀ. ἀέθλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.682
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Hermione</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀντιτυγχάνων</span>
			<i>any chance person</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1918
			</span></i>, al. (Delph.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ βωλὰ ἁντιτυχόνσα</span> the council
				<i>for the time being,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.554
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Argos</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				ἔφοροι . . ἀεὶ οἱ ἀντιτυγχάνοντες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(1).1146
			</span></i> (Gythium, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.3080
			</span></i> (Lebad.), <i><span class="en">
				5(2).266
			</span></i> (Mantinea, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Delph.</u>
				3(1).294
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 v5
			</span></i>.</div>
